  "option_id": "argon-c07-c",
  "title": "Argon C07-C \u2014 User Design C Perfected (Stepped Bridge Day Plate & Extended Lower Bar)",
  "subtitle": "Direct West Entry + Stepped-in SW Kitchen (16.8 m\u00b2) + SE Dining (14.4 m\u00b2) + Wide Living (49.6 m\u00b2); Extended West Lower Utility Wing",
  "summary": "Directly implements the homeowner's Option C from redesign-0109-r5 with all review & stmt-021 fixes: features a clear West Bridge Arrival Door directly on the West exterior wall (fixing the notch door), direct entry into the NW Suite (never through the closet), stepped-in SW Bridge Kitchen (16.8 m\u00b2), SE Dining (14.4 m\u00b2), and a wide, generous East Family Living + NE Prayer Room (49.6 m\u00b2, 4.8\u20135.2 m wide), while the Lower Floor extends west of the Core Stair (u=2.4..5.6m) for a 20.4 m\u00b2 Laundry & 16.0 m\u00b2 Store wing, with the NE Suite + Seated Ensuite, Center-East Garden Lounge, and South Boys + Girls + right-sized SE Baths.",
